{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02790","headline":"酬杨比部员外暮宿琴堂朝跻书阁率尔见赠之作 · 卢照邻","name":"酬杨比部员外暮宿琴堂朝跻书阁率尔见赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲拂檐尘看，鸣琴候月弹。\n桃源迷汉姓，松径有秦官。\n空谷归人少，青山背日寒。\n羡君栖隐处，遥望在云端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}